sequenceDiagram
    participant Product as Product<br>[implements GapPeripheralResponse]
    participant CN as CN Peripheral<br>[implements GapPeripheral]

    Note over Product, CN: Assume the CN currently has 2 bonds stored.

    Product->>CN: GapPeripheral.RemoveOldestBond()
    CN-->>Product: GapPeripheralResponse.NumberOfBondsChanged(1)

    Note over Product: NumberOfBondsChanged reports the current bond count after removal (N-1).<br>Oldest bond = least recently used, per proto.
